name issue_151_outage_3s_v2
describe 3 s outage with every v2 switch on: repair and keyframe trace next to libwebrtc's (yardstick for issue #151)
# `outage_3s` with the configuration PR #116 makes the default. Measured on main 7545e8a, seeds 1-5 (ours / libwebrtc 2977, 3222):
#   audio.longest_interruption_ms 3560 / 2977 ; video.longest_freeze_ms 3.7 s / 3.2 s ; cc.queue_p95_ms 78-100 / 38.6
# The lines below lock the level reached. Target (issue #151): audio gap and longest freeze at libwebrtc's, queue p95 within its band.
cc v2
pacer v2
tcc v2
rtx v2
rtcp v2
keyframe v2
allocator v2
packetization v2
audio v2
duration 30s
at 0s  capacity=1500kbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
at 12s down
at 15s up
reverse at 0s delay=30ms
reverse at 12s down
reverse at 15s up
expect audio.longest_interruption_ms < 3700
expect video.longest_freeze_ms < 4000
